<title>USA: Investor holds 9.2 pct Lindberg stake.</title>
<headline>Investor holds 9.2 pct Lindberg stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Miami investor Ira Sochet said Wednesday he holds a 9.2 percent stake in Lindberg Corp or 437,600 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Sochet said he bought 134,600 common shares between July 12 and August 22 at prices ranging from $9 to $9.8125 per share.</p>
</text>
